      "writtenOn": "2026-10-19T19:51:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, ubidi_reorderVisual returns early without writing to indexMap if any level is out of [0, UBIDI_MAX_EXPLICIT_LEVEL] (126). Updated reorderVisual to sentinel-initialize the output buffer, zero-fill and return 0 on failure, and return [] in JS when reorderVisual fails (with a unit test for level 127).",
